member.summary:
Returns a compiled materializer for the reader's current shape (set of columns and
their ordinals). The first call for a given shape incurs a one-time IL-gen cost;
subsequent calls for the same shape are cache hits.

Operator-facing schema sync mode. This is the primary knob exposed in configuration;
it maps onto an internal  and governs how the CRC-gated
__schema_state sentinel reconciles the database with the entity models.
